{%- comment -%}
  SHOPIFY PLUS ONLY — Checkout UI Extension (Checkout Extensibility)

  This block renders a guided information panel in the Shopify checkout
  for Plus merchants. It reassures parents about shipping, pack randomness,
  returns, and payment.

  Placement: Add this as a checkout block in Shopify Admin → Settings → Checkout → Customize.
  Target: checkout.order-summary.block.render-after
{%- endcomment -%}

<div class="checkout-parent-guide" style="
  background: #f0f7fa;
  border: 1px solid #d0e4ed;
  border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
  margin: 1rem 0;
  font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  color: #2D2D2D;
  line-height: 1.6;
">
  <p style="font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: #3B82A0;">
    A Quick Note for Parents
  </p>

  <details style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
    <summary style="cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600;">About the packs in your order</summary>
    <p style="padding: 0.5rem 0 0 0.5rem;">
      Pokémon packs are randomized — think of them like surprise bags.
      Most packs won't contain rare cards, and that's completely normal.
      The fun is in the surprise of opening them together.
    </p>
  </details>

  <details style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
    <summary style="cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600;">Shipping</summary>
    <p style="padding: 0.5rem 0 0 0.5rem;">
      We ship within 1–3 business days. Most orders arrive in 5–7 business days.
      You'll receive a tracking number by email once shipped.
    </p>
  </details>

  <details style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
    <summary style="cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600;">Returns</summary>
    <p style="padding: 0.5rem 0 0 0.5rem;">
      Sealed products can be returned within 30 days. Once packs are opened,
      we can't accept returns because the contents are random.
      Supplies (binders, sleeves) can be returned unused.
    </p>
  </details>

  <details>
    <summary style="cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600;">Payment & taxes</summary>
    <p style="padding: 0.5rem 0 0 0.5rem;">
      Tax is based on your shipping address. No hidden fees.
      Your payment info is processed securely by Shopify — we never see your card number.
    </p>
  </details>
</div>
